    "https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/universite-grenoble-alpes-/": {
      "title": "Université Grenoble Alpes",
      "description": "Université Grenoble Alpes English EN - English FR - Français Discover Study Science and Innovation Collaborate Open the main menu EN Fermer le menu mobile Discover Study Science and Innovation Collaborate EN - English Fermer le menu mobile FR - Français Home How Does Dust Become a Planet in Multi-Sun Systems? By shedding new light on this fundamental question, astrophysicist Nicolás Cuello is helping us better understand the mechanisms that shape our universe. This research demonstrates theUniversité Grenoble Alpes ’s ability to generate new knowledge through high-level scientific collaborations. Read the article What are you looking for today? Get instant access to the information you're interested in Video Université Grenoble Alpes, Europe's leading university in innovation In 2024, theUniversité Grenoble Alpes took first place among European universities in terms of innovation, with 3,348 patents filed over a 20-year period, from 2000 to 2020. Watch the video A Collective Dynamic At the heart of one of the world’s most dynamic research and innovation ecosystems, theUniversité Grenoble Alpes brings together the academic, scientific, and technological strengths of our region and fosters a unique collective dynamic that enables Grenoble Alpes—with just 0.5% of France’s population—to account for nearly 5% of the nation’s research output. Academic Components The Grenoble National School of Architecture (UGA), Grenoble INP (UGA), and Sciences Po Grenoble (UGA) are constituent institutions. National Research Organizations More information Headlines The Conversation: \"In French Guiana's Gold Mines, a Mixed Record on Soil Remediation\" 14, September 2026 While the methods used to rehabilitate former gold mines in French Guiana have succeeded in curbing erosion to limit pollution, they are still struggling to restore living soils. Read more Vote for the topic of the 2027 Student Citizens' Convention! September 10 , 2026, through October 4 , 2026 What will be the topic of the next Student Citizens’ Convention? From September 10 to October 4, students at theUniversité Grenoble Alpes are invited to vote for their favorite topics from among... Read more The Conversation: \"Our night sky is disappearing: one of the issues at the 2026 International Space Summit\" 9, September 2026 Among the challenges on the agenda, one of the most urgent—and least publicized—is the preservation of the night sky, which is now threatened by the proliferation of satellites. Read more What if you didn't really know much about Grenoble's largest campus? 8, September 2026 Through the Archistoire app, theUniversité Grenoble Alpes , and Grenoble Alpes Métropole invite residents to rediscover one of the most beautiful campuses in Europe. Read more All the latest news Upcoming Events 31 Aug. 31 Office Hours A selection of books at Sciences Po Grenoble-UGA on carbon-free mobility August 31 , 2026 , through October 2 , 2026 Greater Grenoble Area, Saint-Martin-d'Hères - University Campus 01 Sep Contest Challenge: September on a Bike! September 1 , 2026, through September 30 , 2026 Grenoble Metropolitan Area, Valence Metropolitan Area 01 Sep Sustainable Mobility Month September 1 , 2026, through September 30 , 2026 Grenoble Metropolitan Area, Valence Metropolitan Area 10 Sep Exhibition, Tour, Open House 2026 European Heritage Days at UGA September 10 , 2026, through September 19 , 2026 Saint-Martin-d'Hères - University Campus, La Tronche, Grenoble Metropolitan Area 14 Sep Concert Concert / INCR Collective September 14 , 2026, through September 15 , 2026 Grenoble - Presqu'île, Grenoble - Vigny-Musset Site 15 Sep Forum, Conference Student Job Forum 15, September 2026 Saint-Martin-d'Hères - University Campus All Events Université Grenoble Alpes 621 Avenue Centrale 38400 Saint-Martin-d'Hères France +33 (0)4 57 42 21 42 Contact Us News Highlights Headlines Calendar Calls and Campaigns Exhibitions Newsletter Press Practical Information Contact Directio