    "https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/practical-informations/campuses-map/": {
      "title": "Discover our campuses",
      "description": "Discover our campuses - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Université Grenoble Alpes Practical informations Contacts Campuses map English FR - Français EN - English Job site Welcome Search Open the main menu Open the search engine EN Close the mobile menu Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams Practical informations Université Grenoble Alpes Close the mobile menu Return UGA in numbers Recruitment process View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Temporary Teaching and Research Assistants (ATER) Lecturers and Lecturer-researchers Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Contacts Campuses map View the entire section Close the mobile menu FR - Français EN - English Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams LinkedIn Instagram You are here: Home Practical informations Campuses map Discover our campuses Located mainly in the Grenoble area, Université Grenoble Alpes is situated on 13 geographical sites, including Valence. Discover our campuses! Grenoble Located in the heart of a remarkable environment with 3 mountain ranges (Belledonne, Chartreuse and Vercors), Université Grenoble Alpes is situated on several sites in the Grenoble metropolitan area (Grenoble Alpes Métropole). The main campus, located in the districts of Gières and Saint-Martin-d'Hères, is recognized as one of the most beautiful in France, with its 3,000 trees, cultural and sports facilities and unique architecture. Explore Grenoble Valence Université Grenoble Alpes provides around 50 courses on its campus in the Valence region, from bachelor to PhD levels. 5,400 students have access to quality higher education in an exceptional living environment. Explore Valence Other locations UGA is also present on several geographical sites located throughout the region, from Haute-Savoie to the Hautes-Alpes via the Ardèche. Discover our other locations Print Share Share this on Facebook Share this on LinkedIn Published on  July 24, 2020 Updated on March 19, 2025 Practical informations Contacts Campuses map Université Grenoble Alpes Direction générale déléguée aux Ressources humaines 1180 avenue Centrale 38400 Saint-Martin-d'Hères France +33 (0)4 57 42 21 42 Legal notices Personal data Credits Data protection policy Cookies Accessibility: not compliant Sitemap Follow us LinkedIn Instagram URL of the page https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/practical-informations/campuses-map/discover-our-campuses-713844.kjsp?RH=1681215925944 Page title Discover our campuses - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Share the link Copy Copied Close the modal window Share the URL of this page I recommend: Consultable at this address: La page sera alors accessible depuis votre menu \"Mes favoris\". Stop video Play video Mute Play audio Chat: A question? Chatbot Robo Fabrica Matomo traffic statistics X (formerly Twitter) What are you looking for ? Enter a keyword and press Validate Search on text : More » Cookies management Close Cookies management By allowing these third party services, you accept their cookies and the use of tracking technologies necessary for their proper functioning. Learn more about our privacy policy Preference for all services Accept all cookies Refuse all cookies Necessary for the proper functioning of the site This site uses cookies to enhance your user experience Accept Refuse APIs APIs are used to load scripts: geolocation, search engines, translations, ... Google Maps Search API disallowed - This service has not installed any cookie. Accept Refuse Advertising network Ad networks can generate revenue by selling advertising space on the site. Audience measurement Audience measurement services are used to generate visitor statistics, which are useful for improving the site. Matomo traffic statistics disal