    "https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/careers-/senior-lecturers-and-professors/": {
      "title": "Senior Lecturers and Professors",
      "description": "Senior Lecturers and Professors - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Université Grenoble Alpes Practical informations Contacts Campuses map English FR - Français EN - English Job site Welcome Search Open the main menu Open the search engine EN Close the mobile menu Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams Practical informations Université Grenoble Alpes Close the mobile menu Return UGA in numbers Recruitment process View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Temporary Teaching and Research Assistants (ATER) Lecturers and Lecturer-researchers Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Contacts Campuses map View the entire section Close the mobile menu FR - Français EN - English Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams LinkedIn Instagram You are here: Home Careers Senior Lecturers and Professors Senior Lecturers and Professors Senior lecturers (tenured associate professors) and professors have the dual role of developing fundamental and applied research while passing on the resulting knowledge to students. Competitive Examinations Every year, we recruit senior lecturers and professors through competitive examinations, either as part of the campaign run by the Ministry of Higher Education and Research ( session synchronisée ), or of UGA's own campaign ( fil de l'eau ). See more Apply now Tenure-track Junior Professor Positions (CPJ) Through tenure-track junior professor positions ( chaires de professeur junior , CPJ), successful candidates can be awarded tenure as professors or research directors. How to apply Print Share Share this on Facebook Share this on LinkedIn Published on  April 11, 2023 Updated on September 22, 2025 Careers Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members 