    "https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/careers-/phd-students-and-researchers/": {
      "title": "PhD students and researchers",
      "description": "PhD students and researchers - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Université Grenoble Alpes Practical informations Contacts Campuses map English FR - Français EN - English Job site Welcome Search Open the main menu Open the search engine EN Close the mobile menu Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams Practical informations Université Grenoble Alpes Close the mobile menu Return UGA in numbers Recruitment process View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Temporary Teaching and Research Assistants (ATER) Lecturers and Lecturer-researchers Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Contacts Campuses map View the entire section Close the mobile menu FR - Français EN - English Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams LinkedIn Instagram You are here: Home Careers PhD Students and Researchers PhD students and researchers Université Grenoble Alpes regularly recruits doctoral and post-doctoral students who join us to collaborate on research projects conductef by the University. These recruitments are made according to the need. Consult offers Doctoral students With its cutting-edge research and innovation eco-system, Université Grenoble Alpes regularly recruits doctoral students from its various departments. The doctoral school and laboratory websites list the various PhD subjects and funding available, as well as administrative and enrolment procedures, which may vary from one doctoral school to another. Visit the doctoral schools website Post-doctoral students You have completed your PhDand would like to become a researcher? If so, it's possible to obtain on a post-doctoral contract in order to work in the field of research. If you are interested, we invite you to consult our job offers on a regular basis. You can also contact our laboratories or the Collège des Ecoles Doctorales PhD Career Center Consult the PhD Career Center You will be redirected to a French site. Print Share Share this on Facebook Share this on LinkedIn Published on  April 11, 2023 Updated on February 8, 2024 Careers Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers Université Grenoble Alpes Direction générale déléguée aux Ressources humaines 1180 avenue Centrale 38400 Saint-Martin-d'Hères France +33 (0)4 57 42 21 42 Legal notices Personal data Credits Data protection policy Cookies Accessibility: not compliant Sitemap Follow us LinkedIn Instagram URL of the page https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/careers-/phd-students-and-researchers/phd-students-and-researchers-1228617.kjsp?RH=1681204231088 Page title PhD students and researchers - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Share the link Copy Copied Close the modal window Share the URL of this page I recommend: Consultable at this address: La page sera alors accessible depuis votre menu \"Mes favoris\". Stop video Play video Mute Play audio Chat: A question? Chatbot Robo Fabrica Matomo traffic statistics X (formerly Twitter) What are you looking for ? Enter a keyword and press Validate Search on text : More » Cookies management Close Cookies management By allowing these third party services, you accept their cookies and the use of tracking technologies necessary for their proper functioning. Learn more about our privacy policy Preference for all services Accept all cookies Refuse all cookies Necessary for the proper functioning of the site This site uses cookies to enhance your user experience Accept Refuse APIs APIs are used to load scripts: geolocation, search engines, translations, ... Google Maps Search API disallowed - This service has not installed any cookie. Accept Refuse Advertising network Ad networks can generate revenue by selling advertising space on the site. Audience measurement Audi