    "https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/careers-/fixed-term-contract-faculty-members/lecturers-and-lecturer-researchers/": {
      "title": "Lecturers and Lecturer-Researchers",
      "description": "Lecturers and Lecturer-Researchers - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Université Grenoble Alpes Practical informations Contacts Campuses map English FR - Français EN - English Job site Welcome Search Open the main menu Open the search engine EN Working at UGA UGA in numbers Recruitment process Careers Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members Temporary Teaching and Research Assistants (ATER) Lecturers and Lecturer-researchers Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) PhD Students and Researchers Job Offers Competitive Exams Practical informations Contacts Campuses map Université Grenoble Alpes Close the mobile menu FR - Français EN - English Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams LinkedIn Instagram You are here: Home Careers Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members Lecturers and Lecturer-researchers Lecturers and Lecturer-Researchers We hire contract lecturers and lecturers-researchers on a regular basis to fill vacant positions. Current Vacancies See vacancies Eligibility > For lecturer positions (CDD enseignant) : applicants must hold at least a Master's degree or equivalent. > For part-time lecturer and researcher positions (CDD enseignant-chercheur à 50%) : applicants must be enrolled in a PhD programme and provide proof that their thesis will be defended within 12 months (please click here to download a standard statement to be filled in by applicants' thesis supervisors, the document is in French). > For full-time lecturer and researcher positions (CDD enseignant-chercheur à 100%) : applicants must hold at least a PhD or equivalent. How to Apply? Applications must be submitted via the \"Apply\" button on every job description, before the indicated deadline. The following documents must be included: > Detailed CV, > Cover letter, > Examples of research work and any other document that could support the application, > Copy of diploma (+ its translation into French if issued in another language), > Copy of a valid passport (or ID card for EU nationals), > For part-time lecturer and researcher positions: a written statement signed by the applicant's PhD supervisor indicating that the thesis will be defended within 12 months. This document must be written in French. Published on  October 4, 2023 Updated on September 9, 2026 Contact Direction générale déléguée aux ressources humaines Direction du développement des compétences Recrutement des enseignants dgdrh-recrutement-enseignants@univ-grenoble-alpes.fr Nadia Draïdi +33 (0)7 63 55 41 79 Aurore Vernet +33 (0)7 64 43 37 29 Vaniah Raharinosy +33 (0)4 76 74 88 70 Print Share Share this on Facebook Share this on LinkedIn Careers Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers Université Grenoble Alpes Direction générale déléguée aux Ressources humaines 1180 avenue Centrale 38400 Saint-Martin-d'Hères France +33 (0)4 57 42 21 42 Legal notices Personal data Credits Data protection policy Cookies Accessibility: not compliant Sitemap Follow us LinkedIn Instagram URL of the page https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/careers-/fixed-term-contract-faculty-members/lecturers-and-lecturer-researchers/lecturers-and-lecturer-researchers-1305896.kjsp?RH=1696416382602 Page title Share the link Copy Copied Close the modal window Share the URL of this page I recommend: Consultable at this address: La page sera alors accessible depuis votre menu \"Mes favoris\". Stop video Play video Mute Play audio Chat: A question? Chatbot Robo Fabrica Matomo traffic statistics X (formerly Twitter) What are you looking for ? Enter a keyword and press Validate Search on text : More"
