    "https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/careers-/fixed-term-contract-faculty-members/lecteurs-and-maitres-de-langues-native-speaker-assistants-/": {
      "title": "Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants)",
      "description": "Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Université Grenoble Alpes Practical informations Contacts Campuses map English FR - Français EN - English Job site Welcome Search Open the main menu Open the search engine EN Close the mobile menu Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams Practical informations Université Grenoble Alpes Close the mobile menu Return UGA in numbers Recruitment process View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Temporary Teaching and Research Assistants (ATER) Lecturers and Lecturer-researchers Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Contacts Campuses map View the entire section Close the mobile menu FR - Français EN - English Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams LinkedIn Instagram You are here: Home Careers Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) Public higher education institutions may employ native speaker assistants to teach their native language as lecteurs de langue étrangère or maîtres de langue étrangère . See the regulatory text on the status of lecteurs and maîtres de langue étrangère : Décret n°87-754 du 14 septembre 1987 relatif au recrutement de lecteurs de langue étrangère et de maîtres de langue étrangère dans les établissements publics d'enseignement supérieur Current Vacancies See vacancies Eligibility > Applicants must have native or near-native proficiency in the language for which they apply. > Applicants for lecteur positions must have completed one year of a Master's degree, or hold a diploma equivalent to the French Maîtrise . > Applicants for maître de langues positions must hold a Master's degree or equivalent. How to Apply? Applications must be submitted via the \"Apply\" button on every job description, before the indicated deadline. The following documents must be included: > CV > Cover letter > Copy of diploma, and its translation into French > Copy of passport (for non-EU nationals) or both sides of ID card (for EU nationals) Contact Direction générale déléguée aux ressources humaines Direction du développement des compétences Recrutement des enseignants dgdrh-recrutement-enseignants@univ-grenoble-alpes.fr Nadia Draïdi +33 (0)7 63 55 41 79 Aurore Vernet +33 (0)7 64 43 37 29 Vaniah Raharinosy +33 (0)4 76 74 88 70 Print Share Share this on Facebook Share this on LinkedIn Published on  January 7, 2025 Updated on September 9, 2026 Careers Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers Université Grenoble Alpes Direction générale déléguée aux Ressources humaines 1180 avenue Centrale 38400 Saint-Martin-d'Hères France +33 (0)4 57 42 21 42 Legal notices Personal data Credits Data protection policy Cookies Accessibility: not compliant Sitemap Follow us LinkedIn Instagram URL of the page https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/careers-/fixed-term-contract-faculty-members/lecteurs-and-maitres-de-langues-native-speaker-assistants--1533943.kjsp?RH=1756386095389 Page title Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Share the link Copy Copied Close the modal window Share the URL of this page I recommend: Consultable at this address: La page sera alors accessible depuis votre menu \"Mes favoris\". Stop video Play video Mute Play audio Chat: A question? Chatbot Robo Fabrica Matomo traffic statistics X (formerly Twitter) What are you looking for ? Enter a keyword and press Validate Search on text : More » Cookies management Close Cookies management By allowing these third party services, you accept their cookies and the use of tracking technologies ne