    "https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/personal-data/": {
      "title": "Personal data",
      "description": "Personal data - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Université Grenoble Alpes Practical informations Contacts Campuses map English FR - Français EN - English Job site Welcome Search Open the main menu Open the search engine EN Close the mobile menu Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams Practical informations Université Grenoble Alpes Close the mobile menu Return UGA in numbers Recruitment process View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Senior Lecturers and Professors Fixed-term Contract Faculty Members PhD Students and Researchers View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Temporary Teaching and Research Assistants (ATER) Lecturers and Lecturer-researchers Lecteurs and Maîtres de Langues (Native Speaker Assistants) View the entire section Close the mobile menu Return Contacts Campuses map View the entire section Close the mobile menu FR - Français EN - English Working at UGA Careers Job Offers Competitive Exams LinkedIn Instagram You are here: Home Personal data Personal data Personal data protection The personal data processing carried out on this website complies with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 of the European Parliament and of the Council of April 27, 2016 on Personal Data Protection, as well as with Law no. 78-17 of January 6, 1978, as amended, on Information Processing, Files and Freedoms. The establishment has appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO), whom you may contact at the following addresses: dpo@grenet.fr or relaisdpo@univ-grenoble-alpes.fr You have a right of access, rectification, erasure, limitation and portability with regard to your personal data, which you may exercise by contacting: Université Grenoble Alpes Communications Department 621 Avenue Centrale 38400 Saint-Martin-d’Hères communication-universite@univ-grenoble-alpes.fr User activity tracking and functionality cookies When you browse this website, an order is sent to the website server every time you click a link. These requests and the connection data (IP address, date) are stored in files that are only used to ensure that the system functions correctly or to retrace the origins of attempts to compromise the website, in accordance with the regulations in force. Cookies To better serve you, we record the number of pages viewed, the number of visits, the activities of visitors to the website, and the frequency at which they return. This website uses Google Analytics, a website analytics service provided by Google Inc. (Google). Google Analytics uses cookies, which are text files placed on your computer, to help analyze how the website is used by its users. The data generated by the cookies concerning your use of the website (including your IP address) are sent to and stored by Google, who uses these data to analyze the use of the website, compile reports on website activity to be sent to its publisher, and provide other services related to website activity and internet use. Google may share these data with third parties if legally required or if these third parties process data on Google’s behalf, including the publisher of this website. Google will not cross-reference your IP address with any other data in Google’s possession. You may deactivate cookies by selecting the appropriate settings on your browser. Print Share Share this on Facebook Share this on LinkedIn Published on  April 11, 2023 Updated on April 11, 2023 Personal data Université Grenoble Alpes Direction générale déléguée aux Ressources humaines 1180 avenue Centrale 38400 Saint-Martin-d'Hères France +33 (0)4 57 42 21 42 Legal notices Personal data Credits Data protection policy Cookies Accessibility: not compliant Sitemap Follow us LinkedIn Instagram URL of the page https://emploi.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/personal-data/personal-data-1228627.kjsp?RH=1681204807695 Page title Personal data - Emploi - Université Grenoble Alpes Share the link Copy Copied Close the modal window Share the URL of this page I recommend: Consultable at this a